Package: form.model
Title: Neutral Versioned Form Definitions and Workbook Layouts
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tchemit@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Loads explicit YAML resources describing versioned forms,
    fields, declarative constraints, reference requirements, and workbook
    layouts. Checks model definitions against an installed YAML schema and
    semantic invariants, and provides value-like inspection APIs. Does not
    validate submitted data or connect to external services.
License: LGPL-2.1
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/form.model/,
    https://github.com/ultreia-io/form.model
BugReports: https://github.com/ultreia-io/form.model/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: yaml (>= 2.3.10)
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/coverage: covr, xml2
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown, covr, htmltools, xml2
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
